# Power BI Report Server Publish Flow

## Scenario

The company wants to host internal operational reports on-premises.

## Steps

1. Create the report in Power BI Desktop for Report Server.
2. Validate data source connection.
3. Save the PBIX file.
4. Upload the report to the Report Server web portal.
5. Organize the report inside folders.
6. Configure user access.
7. Configure scheduled refresh if supported.
8. Document limitations and maintenance considerations.
